    print(f"""# Offload checklist (live — generated by `offload checklist`)
# Target home: {S.target_home}
# HOT  drive:  {S.hot or '<not configured>'}
# COLD drive:  {S.cold or '<not configured>'}

## Pre-flight
- [ ] HOT mounted (`ls "{S.hot}"` works)
- [ ] COLD mounted (`ls "{S.cold}"` works)
